# Keep the Docker build context small. Image builds only need source + the
# committed dashboard bundle (community_member/web), never Node deps or VCS.
**/node_modules
**/dist
.git
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
**/.pytest_cache
**/.ruff_cache
**/.venv
**/venv
**/.mypy_cache
*.log
.env

# Runtime data + operator secrets must NEVER bake into the image — these are
# generated per-deployment and gitignored, but the build context is the repo
# root, so a local dev run's artifacts would otherwise be COPYed in (caught in
# the live e2e: a stale .chapter-admin-token leaked into the image).
**/.nanda/
**/.org/
**/.chapter-admin-token
**/.org-admin-token
